OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANobel Prize awarded for showing inner
OL,4,Aworkings of the brain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nobel Committee praised the trio
OL,7,Ffor laying the foundation of a new era
OL,8,Fin neuroscience by revealing how to
OL,9,Fswitch on and off neural circuits
OL,10,Fbehind "specific memories, feelings,
OL,11,Fand behaviours relevant for
OL,12,Fneurological and psychiatric
OL,13,Fdisorders".
OL,15,FIn clinical medicine, researchers are
OL,16,Fusing the method to try to restore
OL,17,Fsight in people with visual impairment.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
